    "appearance.light" : {
      "comment" : "The APPEARANCE mode, the light half of System / Light / Dark. It carries an explicit key because \"Light\" is also a sleep stage, and a catalogue key is its English string, so one entry served both and every locale translated the sleep one: Léger, Luz, Światło, 浅睡. Translate this as the opposite of Dark, never as a weight or a lamp.",
      "localizations" : {
